<item><title>Chad’s Déby takes CEEAC chair, pledges focus on implementation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-s-deby-takes-ceeac-chair-pledges-focus-on-c1313c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-s-deby-takes-ceeac-chair-pledges-focus-on-c1313c/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The Central African bloc’s new leader set out priorities including peace, security, economic integration and infrastructure development.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:30:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
