<item><title>Chad aid reaches 2.5 million people as funding covers 46.3% of needs</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-aid-reaches-2-5-million-people-as-funding-covers-46-3-a18c47/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-aid-reaches-2-5-million-people-as-funding-covers-46-3-a18c47/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The response had reached 75% of its initial target by 30 September, but nearly one million people in need remained without assistance.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:52:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-aid-reaches-2-5-million-people-as-funding-covers-46-3-a18c47/share.jpg" length="43470" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-aid-reaches-2-5-million-people-as-funding-covers-46-3-a18c47/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
